{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/c/e5cd2bd19f475b2367d484f34f7be6ea6abc720f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha*\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"39\" height=\"16\" /> is defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/c/6bc172b60902fa76eca5e26934e88245948b1ec0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha*\\beta=\\alpha^2-\\beta^2\\ \\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"206\" height=\"18\" />.\nThe value of the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/d/c8d5601243c954d4130828021cd2ccb268de402e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K=\\left[\\left(1+\\sqrt{3}\\right)*2\\right]*\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"202\" height=\"32\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/3/963022e1c6b1d9fdb90fac95f31e22169ac5f199.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 3\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 0\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\sqrt{3}\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 9\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"356\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/9/219ed323a6f9293c0dd88933bfea0663875c99d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+\\sqrt{3})*2=(1+\\sqrt{3})^2-2^2=1^2+2\\sqrt{3}+3-4=2\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"453\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/0/7708f6c3d78a12a8a5e4fbc9575d2245e3348ee7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt{3}*\\sqrt{2} = 12-2=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyce